  <dashboards>
    <dashboard _.fcp.AccessibleZoneTabOrder.true...enable-sort-zone-taborder='true' name='Glossary'>
      <repository-location id='Glossary' path='/t/Talabat/workbooks/BankPartnershipsDashboardV2_5' revision='' site='Talabat' />
      <style />
      <size maxheight='3000' maxwidth='1400' minheight='3000' minwidth='1400' sizing-mode='fixed' />
      <zones>
        <zone h='100000' id='136' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
          <zone h='99466' id='135' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='98858' x='571' y='267'>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='1400' id='137' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='267'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run fontalignment='1' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='15'>Definitions</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='14000' id='170' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='1667'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>OKR Overview</run>
                <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>1. Target (Discounted GMV): </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>monthly target for bin campaign Discounted GMV.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>2. Discounted GMV: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>this is the Discounted GMV achieved for the month. Note that if a partner is selected, then this is the Discounted GMV achieved through the partner.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>3. Estimated Co-fund (talabat):</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> this is the amount that talabat contributes to the Discounted GMV. This is an estimate, because the actuals would depend on invoicing and reconciliation on the bank&apos;s side.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>4. Discounted Orders: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>this is the number of successful orders that were placed using a bank partnership bin discount.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>5. Users: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>this is the number of users who placed a successful order using a bank partnership bin discount.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>6. Redemptions: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>this is the number of codes that were redeemed (regardless of usage).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>7. Redeemers: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>this is the number of users who redeemed a code (regardless of usage).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>8. Usage % </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10' italic='true'>(Discounted Orders / Redemptions)</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>:</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> this is the proportion of redeemed codes that have been used to place a successful order.</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                <format attr='background-color' value='#f5ead7' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='11300' id='171' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='15667'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Customer Overview</run>
                <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>1. Users: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>number of users who placed at least one successful order using a saved card from the chosen network/bank. </run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   a. Acquisitions: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>number of users who placed their first successful order using a saved card from the chosen network/bank.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   b. Repeat Users: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>number of users who placed at least one successful order using  a saved card from the chosen network/bank and are an existing customer of talabat.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>2. Customer Segments</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   a. One Timers: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>% of users who only placed one successful order in a given month/date.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   b. Low: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>% of users who belong to the low order frequency bucket for a given month/date.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   c. Mid: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>% of users who belong to the mid order frequency bucket for a given month/date.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   d. High:</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> % of users who belong to the high order frequency bucket for a given month/date.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>3. Online User Share: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>proportion of users who placed at least one successful order using a saved card from the chosen network/bank compared to all users who placed a successful order using a saved card for the chosen country.</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='5900' id='172' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='26967'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Pro Users</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>1. Pro Users: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>number of users subscribed to tPro and placed at least one successful order using a saved card from the chosen network/bank.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   a. Pro Regular:</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> number of Pro users who pay for their Pro subscription (monthly/yearly).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   b. Pro Partnership:</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> number of Pro users who subscribed to Pro using a bank tPro partnership (e.g. WIO/tam/Housing Bank/etc).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   c. Pro Lite:</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> number of Pro users who subscribed to Pro using a talabat co-brand card (e.g. ADCB).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>2. Pro User %</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10' italic='true'> (Pro Users / Users):</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> this is the proportion of Pro Users for a given network/bank compared to all Users for that network/bank.</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                <format attr='background-color' value='#f5ead7' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='14100' id='173' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='32867'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Partner Engagement</run>
                <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>1. Orders:</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> number of orders placed by Users in a given month/date using a saved card from the chosen network/bank.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   a. Orders - Pro Users: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>number of orders placed by </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>Pro Users</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> in a given month using a saved card from the chosen network/bank.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>2. GMV: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>amount of GMV from successful orders placed by Users in a given month/date using a saved card from the chosen network/bank.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   a. GMV - Pro Users: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>amount of GMV from successful orders placed by </run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>Pro Users</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> in a given month/date using a saved card from the chosen network/bank.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>3. Spend per User - Non Pro</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10' italic='true'> (GMV - Non Pro / Number of Non Pro Users):</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> average spend of Non Pro users using a saved card from the chosen network/bank.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>4. Spend per User - Pro</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10' italic='true'> (GMV - Pro / Number of Pro Users): </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>average spend of Pro users using a saved card from the chosen network/bank.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>5. Frequency - Non Pro: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>average order frequency of Non Pro users using a saved card from the chosen network/bank.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>5. Frequency - Pro: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>average order frequency of Pro users using a saved card from the chosen network/bank.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>6. Partner Utilization:</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> proportion of orders that come from saved cards of the chosen network/bank compared to orders that come from saved cards of all networks/banks for a given country.</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='16600' id='176' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='46967'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Overall Engagement</run>
                <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>1. Orders: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>number of orders placed by Users (of the chosen network/bank) using any payment method (cash, Apple Pay, saved card from a different network/bank, etc.).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   a. Orders - Pro Users: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>number of orders placed by Pro Users (of the chosen network/bank) using any payment method (cash, Apple Pay, saved card from a different network/bank, etc.).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>2. GMV: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>GMV of orders placed by Users (of the chosen network/bank) using any payment method (cash, Apple Pay, saved card from a different network/bank, etc.)</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   a. GMV- Pro Users: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>GMV of orders placed by Pro Users (of the chosen network/bank) using any payment method (cash, Apple Pay, saved card from a different network/bank, etc.).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>3. Spend per User - Non Pro: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>average spend of Non Pro Users (of the chosen network/bank) using any payment method (cash, Apple Pay, saved card from a different network/bank, etc.).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>4. Spend per User - Pro: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>average spend of Pro Users (of the chosen network/bank) using any payment method (cash, Apple Pay, saved card from a different network/bank, etc.).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>5. Frequency - Non Pro: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>average order frequency of Non Pro Users (of the chosen network/bank) using any payment method (cash, Apple Pay, saved card from a different network/bank, etc.).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>6. Frequency - Pro:</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> average order frequency of Pro Users (of the chosen network/bank) using any payment method (cash, Apple Pay, saved card from a different network/bank, etc.).</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                <format attr='background-color' value='#f5ead7' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='9000' id='177' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='63567'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Partner Share</run>
                <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>1. Order Share: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>% of orders placed by a User using a saved card of the chosen network/bank compared to orders placed using any payment method (cash, Apple Pay, saved card from a different network/bank, etc.).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   a. Credit: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>% of orders placed by a User using a saved CREDIT card of the chosen network/bank compared to orders placed using  any payment method.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   b. Debit:</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> % of orders placed by a User using a saved DEBIT card of the chosen network/bank compared to orders placed using  any payment method.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>2. GMV Share: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>% of GMV coming from orders placed by a User using a saved card of the chosen network/bank compared to orders placed using  any payment method (cash, Apple Pay, saved card from a different network/bank, etc.).</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   a. Credit: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>% of GMV coming from orders placed by a User using a saved CREDIT card of the chosen network/bank compared to orders placed using  any payment method.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   b. Debit: </run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>% of GMV coming from orders placed by a User using a saved DEBIT card of the chosen network/bank compared to orders placed using  any payment method.</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='3500' id='182' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='72567'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Bin Performance</run>
                <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>This table gives the performance of 6 digit bins on talabat for the chosen market. Note that this only includes successful order transactions from saved cards on talabat for the previous 6 complete months. </run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                <format attr='background-color' value='#f5ead7' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
            <zone forceUpdate='true' h='7500' id='183' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='76067'>
              <formatted-text>
                <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Campaign Level Details</run>
                <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>This allows tracking of Discounted GMV on a campaign level for all markets. Note:</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>1. Use the filters to select the country, code, daily/monthly view option.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>2. In the monthly view, you can see 12 months of data, and in the daily view you can see the data for the last 60 days.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>3. Est Co-fund (talabat) is just an estimated co-fund amount based on the co-fund values entered in the campaign name. If no co-fund details are available in the campaign name, this value is zero.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>4. This data may be T-2 depending on the dashboard refresh.</run>
                <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>5. Any campaigns with the word &quot;test&quot; are excluded here.</run>
              </formatted-text>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='4' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zone>
          <zone-style>
            <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
            <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
            <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
            <format attr='margin' value='8' />
          </zone-style>
        </zone>
      </zones>
      <devicelayouts>
        <devicelayout auto-generated='true' name='Phone'>
          <size maxheight='700' minheight='700' sizing-mode='vscroll' />
          <zones>
            <zone h='100000' id='279' type-v2='layout-basic' w='100000' x='0' y='0'>
              <zone h='84000' id='278' param='vert' type-v2='layout-flow' w='84000' x='8000' y='8000'>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='1400' id='137' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='267'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run fontalignment='1' fontname='Tableau Bold' fontsize='15'>Definitions</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='14000' id='170' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='1667'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>OKR Overview</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>1. Target (Discounted GMV): </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>monthly target for bin campaign Discounted GMV.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>2. Discounted GMV: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>this is the Discounted GMV achieved for the month. Note that if a partner is selected, then this is the Discounted GMV achieved through the partner.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>3. Estimated Co-fund (talabat):</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> this is the amount that talabat contributes to the Discounted GMV. This is an estimate, because the actuals would depend on invoicing and reconciliation on the bank&apos;s side.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>4. Discounted Orders: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>this is the number of successful orders that were placed using a bank partnership bin discount.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>5. Users: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>this is the number of users who placed a successful order using a bank partnership bin discount.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>6. Redemptions: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>this is the number of codes that were redeemed (regardless of usage).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>7. Redeemers: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>this is the number of users who redeemed a code (regardless of usage).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>8. Usage % </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10' italic='true'>(Discounted Orders / Redemptions)</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> this is the proportion of redeemed codes that have been used to place a successful order.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#f5ead7' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='11300' id='171' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='15667'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Customer Overview</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>1. Users: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>number of users who placed at least one successful order using a saved card from the chosen network/bank. </run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   a. Acquisitions: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>number of users who placed their first successful order using a saved card from the chosen network/bank.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   b. Repeat Users: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>number of users who placed at least one successful order using  a saved card from the chosen network/bank and are an existing customer of talabat.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>2. Customer Segments</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   a. One Timers: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>% of users who only placed one successful order in a given month/date.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   b. Low: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>% of users who belong to the low order frequency bucket for a given month/date.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   c. Mid: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>% of users who belong to the mid order frequency bucket for a given month/date.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   d. High:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> % of users who belong to the high order frequency bucket for a given month/date.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>3. Online User Share: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>proportion of users who placed at least one successful order using a saved card from the chosen network/bank compared to all users who placed a successful order using a saved card for the chosen country.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='5900' id='172' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='26967'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Pro Users</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>1. Pro Users: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>number of users subscribed to tPro and placed at least one successful order using a saved card from the chosen network/bank.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   a. Pro Regular:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> number of Pro users who pay for their Pro subscription (monthly/yearly).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   b. Pro Partnership:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> number of Pro users who subscribed to Pro using a bank tPro partnership (e.g. WIO/tam/Housing Bank/etc).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   c. Pro Lite:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> number of Pro users who subscribed to Pro using a talabat co-brand card (e.g. ADCB).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>2. Pro User %</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10' italic='true'> (Pro Users / Users):</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> this is the proportion of Pro Users for a given network/bank compared to all Users for that network/bank.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#f5ead7' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='14100' id='173' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='32867'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Partner Engagement</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>1. Orders:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> number of orders placed by Users in a given month/date using a saved card from the chosen network/bank.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   a. Orders - Pro Users: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>number of orders placed by </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>Pro Users</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> in a given month using a saved card from the chosen network/bank.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>2. GMV: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>amount of GMV from successful orders placed by Users in a given month/date using a saved card from the chosen network/bank.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   a. GMV - Pro Users: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>amount of GMV from successful orders placed by </run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>Pro Users</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> in a given month/date using a saved card from the chosen network/bank.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>3. Spend per User - Non Pro</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10' italic='true'> (GMV - Non Pro / Number of Non Pro Users):</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> average spend of Non Pro users using a saved card from the chosen network/bank.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>4. Spend per User - Pro</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10' italic='true'> (GMV - Pro / Number of Pro Users): </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>average spend of Pro users using a saved card from the chosen network/bank.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>5. Frequency - Non Pro: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>average order frequency of Non Pro users using a saved card from the chosen network/bank.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>5. Frequency - Pro: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>average order frequency of Pro users using a saved card from the chosen network/bank.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>6. Partner Utilization:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> proportion of orders that come from saved cards of the chosen network/bank compared to orders that come from saved cards of all networks/banks for a given country.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='16600' id='176' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='46967'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Overall Engagement</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>1. Orders: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>number of orders placed by Users (of the chosen network/bank) using any payment method (cash, Apple Pay, saved card from a different network/bank, etc.).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   a. Orders - Pro Users: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>number of orders placed by Pro Users (of the chosen network/bank) using any payment method (cash, Apple Pay, saved card from a different network/bank, etc.).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>2. GMV: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>GMV of orders placed by Users (of the chosen network/bank) using any payment method (cash, Apple Pay, saved card from a different network/bank, etc.)</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   a. GMV- Pro Users: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>GMV of orders placed by Pro Users (of the chosen network/bank) using any payment method (cash, Apple Pay, saved card from a different network/bank, etc.).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>3. Spend per User - Non Pro: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>average spend of Non Pro Users (of the chosen network/bank) using any payment method (cash, Apple Pay, saved card from a different network/bank, etc.).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>4. Spend per User - Pro: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>average spend of Pro Users (of the chosen network/bank) using any payment method (cash, Apple Pay, saved card from a different network/bank, etc.).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>5. Frequency - Non Pro: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>average order frequency of Non Pro Users (of the chosen network/bank) using any payment method (cash, Apple Pay, saved card from a different network/bank, etc.).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>6. Frequency - Pro:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> average order frequency of Pro Users (of the chosen network/bank) using any payment method (cash, Apple Pay, saved card from a different network/bank, etc.).</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#f5ead7' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='9000' id='177' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='63567'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Partner Share</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>1. Order Share: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>% of orders placed by a User using a saved card of the chosen network/bank compared to orders placed using any payment method (cash, Apple Pay, saved card from a different network/bank, etc.).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   a. Credit: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>% of orders placed by a User using a saved CREDIT card of the chosen network/bank compared to orders placed using  any payment method.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   b. Debit:</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'> % of orders placed by a User using a saved DEBIT card of the chosen network/bank compared to orders placed using  any payment method.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>2. GMV Share: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>% of GMV coming from orders placed by a User using a saved card of the chosen network/bank compared to orders placed using  any payment method (cash, Apple Pay, saved card from a different network/bank, etc.).</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   a. Credit: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>% of GMV coming from orders placed by a User using a saved CREDIT card of the chosen network/bank compared to orders placed using  any payment method.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run bold='true' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>   b. Debit: </run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>% of GMV coming from orders placed by a User using a saved DEBIT card of the chosen network/bank compared to orders placed using  any payment method.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='3500' id='182' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='72567'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Bin Performance</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>This table gives the performance of 6 digit bins on talabat for the chosen market. Note that this only includes successful order transactions from saved cards on talabat for the previous 6 complete months. </run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                    <format attr='background-color' value='#f5ead7' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
                <zone forceUpdate='true' h='7500' id='183' type-v2='text' w='98858' x='571' y='76067'>
                  <formatted-text>
                    <run bold='true' fontalignment='1' fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='12'>Campaign Level Details</run>
                    <run fontalignment='1'>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>This allows tracking of Discounted GMV on a campaign level for all markets. Note:</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>1. Use the filters to select the country, code, daily/monthly view option.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>2. In the monthly view, you can see 12 months of data, and in the daily view you can see the data for the last 60 days.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>3. Est Co-fund (talabat) is just an estimated co-fund amount based on the co-fund values entered in the campaign name. If no co-fund details are available in the campaign name, this value is zero.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>4. This data may be T-2 depending on the dashboard refresh.</run>
                    <run>Æ&#10;</run>
                    <run fontcolor='#333333' fontsize='10'>5. Any campaigns with the word &quot;test&quot; are excluded here.</run>
                  </formatted-text>
                  <zone-style>
                    <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                    <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                    <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                    <format attr='margin' value='4' />
                    <format attr='padding' value='0' />
                  </zone-style>
                </zone>
              </zone>
              <zone-style>
                <format attr='border-color' value='#000000' />
                <format attr='border-style' value='none' />
                <format attr='border-width' value='0' />
                <format attr='margin' value='8' />
              </zone-style>
            </zone>
          </zones>
        </devicelayout>
      </devicelayouts>
      <simple-id uuid='{8834D01E-5DC3-449A-B1CC-F45CA333E7FA}' />
    </dashboard>
